WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.640
AMOS:
He did it!

00:00:04.848 --> 00:00:05.849
[SCREAMS]

00:00:06.099 --> 00:00:07.643
DUMBLEDORE:
Harry!

00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:11.730
Harry!

00:00:12.981 --> 00:00:16.318
No! No! No, don't!

00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:18.487
For God's sake, Dumbledore,
what's happened?

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:21.365
He's back. He's back.

00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:23.575
Voldemort's back.

00:00:23.659 --> 00:00:26.078
Cedric, he asked me
to bring his body back.

00:00:26.245 --> 00:00:28.580
I couldn't leave him, not there.

00:00:28.664 --> 00:00:31.583
It's all right, Harry. It's all right.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.002
He's home. You both are.

00:00:34.211 --> 00:00:37.756
Keep everybody in their seats.
A boy has just been killed.

00:00:40.759 --> 00:00:44.596
The body must be moved, Dumbledore.
There are too many people.

00:00:44.763 --> 00:00:46.598
Let me through.

00:00:46.682 --> 00:00:48.225
Let me through!

00:00:50.143 --> 00:00:51.395
Let me through!

00:00:51.645 --> 00:00:52.896
That's my son!

00:00:54.273 --> 00:00:55.691
That's my boy!

00:00:58.652 --> 00:01:01.280
It's my boy!

00:01:01.989 --> 00:01:03.532
[SOBS]

00:01:04.032 --> 00:01:07.661
-Come on. Get up. Easy, easy!
-No.

00:01:07.744 --> 00:01:10.706
This is not where you want to be
right now. Come on.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.709
No!

00:01:16.712 --> 00:01:19.131
It's all right, I got you.

00:01:19.298 --> 00:01:22.718
I got you. Come on. Easy, now.

00:01:26.722 --> 00:01:28.432
AMOS:
No!

00:01:29.641 --> 00:01:31.435
No!

00:02:13.769 --> 00:02:15.604
Are you all right, Potter?

00:02:16.063 --> 00:02:17.981
Does it hurt? That?

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:19.858
Not so much now.

00:02:20.859 --> 00:02:22.986
Perhaps I'd better take a look at it.

00:02:26.114 --> 00:02:28.116
HARRY:
The cup was a Portkey.

00:02:30.786 --> 00:02:32.788
Someone had bewitched it.

00:02:32.871 --> 00:02:34.998
What was it like?

00:02:35.457 --> 00:02:37.000
-What was he like?
-Who?

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:38.877
The Dark Lord.

00:02:39.461 --> 00:02:40.796
HARRY:
Aah!

00:02:41.338 --> 00:02:44.466
What was it like
to stand in his presence?

00:02:45.759 --> 00:02:47.511
I don't know.

00:02:47.886 --> 00:02:50.138
[GRUNTING]

00:02:50.347 --> 00:02:53.266
It was like I'd fallen
into one of my dreams...

00:02:56.228 --> 00:02:58.230
...into one of my nightmares.

00:03:12.661 --> 00:03:14.037
[GASPS]

00:03:16.873 --> 00:03:18.542
Were there others?

00:03:18.792 --> 00:03:20.544
In the graveyard, were there others?

00:03:20.752 --> 00:03:22.254
Um....

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:26.299
I....

00:03:26.925 --> 00:03:30.846
I don't think I said anything
about a graveyard, professor.

00:03:38.311 --> 00:03:41.690
[IMITATING HAGRID] "Marvelous
creatures, dragons, aren't they?"

00:03:45.944 --> 00:03:49.072
Did you think that oaf
would've led you into the woods...

00:03:49.281 --> 00:03:51.158
...if I hadn't suggested it?

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.785
[BOTTLES CLANKING]

00:03:54.828 --> 00:03:58.415
Do you think Cedric Diggory would've
told you to open the egg underwater...

00:03:58.582 --> 00:04:00.959
...if I hadn't told him first myself?

00:04:02.794 --> 00:04:05.338
Did you think Neville Longbottom,
the witless wonder...

00:04:05.589 --> 00:04:08.800
...could've provided you with gillyweed
if I hadn't given him the book...

00:04:08.884 --> 00:04:10.469
...that led him straight to it? Huh?

00:04:12.554 --> 00:04:13.889
Eh?

00:04:18.894 --> 00:04:22.898
It was you from the beginning.
You put my name in the Goblet of Fire.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.983
You bewitched Krum, but you--

00:04:25.233 --> 00:04:26.985
[MOCKING]
"But-- But--"

00:04:27.235 --> 00:04:29.446
You won because I made it so, Potter.

00:04:29.988 --> 00:04:33.617
You ended up in that graveyard tonight
because it was meant to be so.

00:04:33.825 --> 00:04:34.951
And now the deed is done.

00:04:35.202 --> 00:04:36.244
[HARRY GRUNTS]

00:04:36.745 --> 00:04:40.957
The blood that runs through these veins
runs within the Dark Lord.

00:04:44.127 --> 00:04:45.921
[SIGHS AND SPITS]

00:04:49.591 --> 00:04:52.969
Imagine how he will reward me
when he learns...

00:04:53.929 --> 00:04:56.473
...that I have once and for all...

00:04:57.015 --> 00:05:01.394
...silenced the great Harry Potter.

00:05:01.645 --> 00:05:02.938
DUMBLEDORE:
Expelliarmus!

00:05:07.609 --> 00:05:08.902
Severus.

00:05:10.779 --> 00:05:11.863
[GASPING]

00:05:11.947 --> 00:05:13.782
DUMBLEDORE:
That's it, take it.

00:05:14.866 --> 00:05:18.161
-Do you know who I am?
-Albus Dumbledore.

00:05:18.411 --> 00:05:21.039
-Are you Alastor Moody? Are you?
-No.

00:05:21.248 --> 00:05:24.376
Is he in this room? Is he in this room?

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:28.964
Harry, away from there!

00:05:49.985 --> 00:05:53.196
DUMBLEDORE: You all right, Alastor?
-I'm sorry, Albus.

00:05:54.197 --> 00:05:56.283
That's Moody. But then who's--?

00:05:56.449 --> 00:05:57.951
[SNIFFS]

00:05:58.034 --> 00:05:59.077
Polyjuice Potion.

00:05:59.327 --> 00:06:02.664
Now we know who's been stealing
from your stores, Severus.

00:06:02.956 --> 00:06:04.207
We'll get you up in a minute.

00:06:04.457 --> 00:06:06.001
[GROANS]

00:06:06.084 --> 00:06:08.044
[GURGLING]

00:06:12.465 --> 00:06:14.593
[GRUNTING AND GAGGING]

00:06:22.225 --> 00:06:24.853
[SCREAMS]

00:06:38.742 --> 00:06:40.619
-Aah!
-Harry!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.499
Barty Crouch Junior.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.711
I'll show you mine
if you show me yours.

00:06:52.047 --> 00:06:53.131
Your arm, Harry.

00:06:57.594 --> 00:06:59.888
CROUCH JUNIOR:
You know what this means, don't you?

00:07:00.764 --> 00:07:02.057
He's back.

00:07:03.141 --> 00:07:05.393
Lord Voldemort has returned.

00:07:06.269 --> 00:07:08.730
I'm sorry, sir. I couldn't help it.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:13.401
Send an owl to Azkaban. I think
they'll find they're missing a prisoner.

00:07:13.985 --> 00:07:16.363
-I'll be welcomed back like a hero.
DUMBLEDORE: Perhaps.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:19.908
Personally, I've never had much time
for heroes.

00:07:30.794 --> 00:07:32.921
[OWL HOOTING]
